/- English proof (translation)
Establish `s0` using `@GlobalTheory.SplitScalar.symplO_zero_right D`. Establish `mA : ∀ a : WO J.W₀ T, J.d.ext0 T a ∈ Γ → (o.resT J.W₀).symm (a, 0) ∈ ΓX` using `fun a ha => by`. Rewrite using `[hX, AddEquiv.apply_symm_apply]`. Conclude with `⟨ha, zero_mem _⟩`. Establish `mB : ∀ b : WO J.W₀ L'', (show WO J.W₀ (negSp L'') from b) ∈ ΓL → (o.resT J.W₀).symm (0, b) ∈ ΓX` using `fun b hb => by`.

